flowchart LR
  accTitle: Durable Object authority
  accDescr: An authenticated application admits input to a Durable Object, whose alarm activates a native executor or Wasm host. The executor writes fenced journal and state back to the object, and runs the shared Everruns runtime with providers and tools.
  A[Authenticated application] -->|Admit input| D[Durable Object]
  D -->|Alarm activation| E[Native executor or Wasm host]
  E -->|Fenced journal and state| D
  E --> R[Shared Everruns runtime]
  R --> T[Providers and tools]
